{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 101,
  "result": {
    "resultType": "complete",
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "get_weather",
        "description": "Get current weather information for a location",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "location": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "City name or zip code"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "location"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "ttlMs": 300000,
    "cacheScope": "public",
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {
        "name": "classroom-weather-fixture",
        "version": "1.0.0"
      }
    }
  }
}

应用将工具说明整理给模型，供后续生成调用。

请求与返回按编号配对；协议消息由应用和服务处理。
